            "body": "The `tangle` check is red, but not because of this PR. Running `tools/check-tangle.sh` on this branch lists only `sp-search.el` and `sp-org-custom-highlight.el` as differing from their docs, and this PR touches neither. They are fixed by #253 and #252, so the check should go green once those merge into `main`. `sp-org-tag-groups` (the module this PR changes) is not in the list. I haven't pulled the CI log's detail lines, so that comes from my local run. `build` and `markers` passed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
